#ASSERT `s 462.321(5) the seized property may be returned to the person lawfully entitled to its possession` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `ccc14 Y`
#ASSERT `s 462.321(5) the seized property may be returned to the person lawfully entitled to its possession` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
